      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Based on the data, I'd recommend Zip 90211, 90213, and 90214 for the new community centers. These zip codes have the most diverse populations, with significant percentages of Black and Hispanic residents, which will allow the centers to cater to the needs of the most marginalized communities. Zip 90211, with its high crime rate, will likely require more resources to address, making it a prime location for a community center. Zip 90213's high crime rate and predominantly Black population also make it an ideal candidate. Lastly, Zip 90214's mix of White, Hispanic, and Asian residents will provide a unique opportunity to create a center that serves a broad spectrum of cultural needs.",
